{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ 「別冊カドカワ」10/3 発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな曲についてお話しました。\n悩んで悩んで選び出したお気に入りの5曲！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を選んだかはお楽しみにっ( *ˆoˆ* )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、舞台についてもお話させて\n頂いてます♩ ぜひぜひチェックしてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ 「乃木坂工事中」10/2 放送 ←今日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ夏休みの課題発表です。\nみんな、全国ツアーの合間をぬって頑張ってたのでぜひ見てほしいなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も空中ブランコに挑戦したよ(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ３日間、京都でお仕事してました♩♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、セブンイレブン限定ミニライブ\n来て下さった皆さん、有難うございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、\n15th最後の全国握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアはかりんちゃんと！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃんも、かりんちゃん推しの皆さんも\n有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブで、「行くあてのない僕たち」を\n披露するのもこれが最後でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次できるとしたらもうバースデーライブ\nくらいになっちゃうのかな(◎o◎)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲を歌えて、本当に本当に有難かったです。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも大切な一曲です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、本日は個別握手会でした**"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎私服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：earth music&ecology"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：DHOLIC"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：DHOLIC"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：adidas"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"：zoff CLASSIC ボストン\n時計：G-SHOCK"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪は、編み込みしてました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンには、ファンのみんなが作ってくれた\nユニットのポスターが沢山！！！！( *ˆoˆ* )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくてほっこり(•ᵕᴗᵕ•)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか映画のポスターみたいだ！（笑）（笑）\nこんなかっこよく作ってくれて有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は今日は、リクエストに応えて\n例の衣装も着たんだけど、恥ずかしいので\n写メなしで悪しからず...笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた方だけのあれってことで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンやクリスマスに近い日程のときも、\n終日それなりの衣装着ようと思ってます。\n新年一発目もなんかやろうかなあ(+o+)\n恥ずかしいので、来てくれた方のあれってやつで！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいことに気づいてしまったぞ(  *o*  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと...、今...、10月らしい！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひゃーーーー！(ホラー的悲鳴)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってた？？ ( °_° )ふぇ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風が冷たくなってきたね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかくして寝てね！お休み！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/10/02/2001879/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}